{"id":"c907d80d-f305-5558-bcbf-29ffd17d0f5d","title":"服务器运维","icon":"🛠️","cover":"none","parentId":"884a4104-344d-51e1-a1cd-c1f80f892d20","favorite":false,"archived":false,"createdAt":"2026-10-15T00:00:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-15T00:00:00.000Z","content":{"type":"surface","attrs":{"id":"root","kind":"page","name":"服务器运维","widthMode":"standard"},"content":[{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-hero","version":"1.0.0","props":{"eyebrow":"自托管","title":"备份、迁移与维护服务器","lead":"为自己部署的 ShowAI 服务器做一致备份、恢复和切换主机，把旧的 D1 部署迁到 Durable Object，清理无引用对象、核对中断的上传，并控制请求预算。Linux 和 Cloudflare 使用同一套运维协议。","facts":[{"label":"运维工具","value":"scripts/server-backup.mjs"},{"label":"运维密钥","value":"64 位小写十六进制"},{"label":"清理","value":"默认只出报告"},{"label":"铁律","value":"同一服务器只留一个可写副本"}],"actions":[{"label":"部署服务器","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/project-server","primary":true},{"label":"ShowAI Cloud","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/cloud"}],"art":"dev"},"integrity":"sha256-7c2bbe84b00357b5e96de32cad51cf6537d38c28d4eadca35435483ba772646e"},"id":"node-35d47c88"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-36d47e1b"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"开始之前"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"设置运维密钥","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"："},{"type":"text","text":"SHOWAI_OPERATIONS_KEY","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 为 32 字节随机数，编码成 64 位小写十六进制。它与用户密码和会话无关；未设置时运维接口一律返回 404。Cloudflare 的每个环境用 Wrangler secret 安装各自独立的密钥。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-a75c94b6"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-5feddf19"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"单独保管保险库密钥","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：Linux 是数据目录里的 "},{"type":"text","text":"vault.key","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"，Cloudflare 是 "},{"type":"text","text":"SHOWAI_VAULT_KEY","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"。备份里的模型凭据是用它加密的，换了密钥就无法找回，恢复工具也不会替你生成新密钥。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-4c84bfe1"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-5eeddd86"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"在仓库根目录构建并运行工具","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：先执行 "},{"type":"text","text":"npm run build:server","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"，运维脚本从 "},{"type":"text","text":"dist-server/server.mjs","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 加载服务端代码。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-510e1e6c"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-5deddbf3"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"只通过安全通道访问","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"：远程使用 HTTPS，或通过 SSH 转发连接回环地址。密钥文件只让自己可读，不要放进仓库。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-f6364997"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-5cedda60"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-37d47fae"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-38d48141"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"做一次一致备份"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"备份包含所有账号与密码摘要、设备会话状态、账号绑定、加密的模型资源、成员与邀请、配额预留、上传任务、完整修订图和私有对象清单；基础设施密钥不在其中。恢复后"},{"type":"text","text":"服务器身份保持不变","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-39d482d4"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-steps","version":"1.0.0","props":{"steps":[{"title":"导出到一个新目录","body":"导出会**冻结源服务器**：数据库拒绝之后的所有写入，等已接纳的写入清零后再复制元数据和对象。新目录权限为 0700，文件为 0600。","code":"node scripts/server-backup.mjs export --url https://showai.example.com/cloud \\\n  --key-file /secure/source-operations.key \\\n  --destination /secure/backups/showai-2026-10-09","result":"返回的 JSON 回执包含 `serverId`、各类数量和已核验字节数；完整清单和逐文件摘要在 `backup.json`。"},{"title":"核验备份","code":"node scripts/server-backup.mjs verify --backup /secure/backups/showai-2026-10-09","body":"逐一检查对象、元数据、清单、父序列、阅读器和依赖闭包。"},{"title":"传输中断时续做","body":"加上 `--resume` 复用同一冻结代号和已核验的文件。源服务器在此期间被重新打开、结构变化或冻结代号变化时，续做会失败。","code":"node scripts/server-backup.mjs export --url https://showai.example.com/cloud \\\n  --key-file /secure/source-operations.key \\\n  --destination /secure/backups/showai-2026-10-09 --resume"},{"title":"决定由哪一方继续服务","body":"**导出完成或失败后，源服务器都保持冻结。** 只是例行备份时，查询当前冻结代号后重新打开源服务器；要迁移时，见下一节。","code":"node scripts/server-backup.mjs state --url https://showai.example.com/cloud \\\n  --key-file /secure/source-operations.key\nnode scripts/server-backup.mjs unfreeze --url https://showai.example.com/cloud \\\n  --key-file /secure/source-operations.key --epoch CURRENT_FROZEN_GENERATION"}]},"integrity":"sha256-660edad476b2fda02cf5d65a2e90470d95d7c2335d975efaa102a0360d58f20a"},"id":"node-3ad48467"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-3bd485fa"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"恢复并切换到新主机"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"备份可以恢复到 Linux 主机，包括从 Cloudflare 迁到 Linux。客户端用原来的账号和 Token 直接重连，不需要重新加入项目。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-3cd4878d"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-sequence","version":"1.0.0","props":{"title":"从源服务器切换到新的 Linux 主机","actors":[{"id":"op","label":"运维者","sub":"server-backup.mjs","icon":"🛠️","tone":"slate"},{"id":"src","label":"源服务器","icon":"🗄️","tone":"warm"},{"id":"dst","label":"目标服务器","sub":"Linux","icon":"🗄️","tone":"teal"},{"id":"cli","label":"客户端","icon":"💻","tone":"brand"}],"steps":[{"from":"op","to":"src","label":"export：冻结并导出","kind":"call","detail":"源服务器从此保持冻结，不再接受写入。"},{"from":"src","to":"op","label":"备份 + serverId","kind":"reply"},{"from":"op","to":"op","label":"verify，并复制到目标主机","kind":"note","detail":"通过受保护的通道复制完整备份，同时单独带上原保险库密钥。"},{"from":"op","to":"dst","label":"restore 到新目录","kind":"call","detail":"拒绝已存在的目录；核验后才发布新目录。恢复出的数据库**保持冻结**。用与 Node 服务相同的系统用户运行。"},{"from":"op","to":"dst","label":"启动并检查","kind":"call","detail":"`SHOWAI_SERVER_HOME` 指向恢复目录，`SHOWAI_SERVER_URL` 保留原来的基址前缀，配置目标的运维密钥。检查 `/api/info`、现有会话、项目角色、修订与对象数量。"},{"from":"op","to":"dst","label":"unfreeze：只重开目标","kind":"call","detail":"使用 restore 或 state 返回的冻结代号。"},{"from":"cli","to":"dst","label":"用原账号重连","kind":"call","detail":"serverId 和用户身份一致，连接、项目绑定、默认连接和缓存都保留；有效的 Token 继续有效，已过期或撤销的保持原状。"},{"from":"op","to":"op","label":"核验后再切换公共路由","kind":"note","detail":"先用两个独立内容库确认同步继续正常、查看者限制仍生效。"}]},"integrity":"sha256-54ea7e21b2eb7835fb0ba41ca4d48f1ab21bc27b88b7f8fa2b03d3b910b05e76"},"id":"node-2dd46ff0"}},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"sh","id":"node-2ed47183"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 在目标主机上恢复到一个新目录\nnode scripts/server-backup.mjs restore --backup /secure/backups/showai-2026-10-09 \\\n  --home /srv/showai/restored-data\n\n# 启动并检查后，查询冻结代号，只重开目标\nnode scripts/server-backup.mjs state --url https://target.example/cloud \\\n  --key-file /secure/target-operations.key\nnode scripts/server-backup.mjs unfreeze --url https://target.example/cloud \\\n  --key-file /secure/target-operations.key --epoch CURRENT_FROZEN_GENERATION"}]},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"icon":"⚠️","tone":"rose","id":"node-7b829db1"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"不要让同一个服务器身份的两个可写副本同时接收流量。","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 目标接受新修改后再重新打开迁移前的源服务器，会丢掉这些修改。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-66eba63e"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"要回滚：先冻结并导出目标上的新写入，保持目标冻结；把最新的完整备份恢复到一个新的源目录，核验后只重新打开它。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-67eba7d1"}}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-7a829c1e"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"从 D1 迁到 Durable Object"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"当前 Cloudflare 配置默认使用 "},{"type":"text","text":"SHOWAI_METADATA_DRIVER=durable","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"。旧的 D1 部署必须先迁移，再切换到默认配置。旧的 R2 归档和新的热对象都会保留在完整对象清单里。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-79829a8b"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-steps","version":"1.0.0","props":{"steps":[{"title":"构建并应用 D1 结构迁移","code":"npm run build:server\nnpx wrangler@4.148.0 d1 migrations apply DB --remote --config deployments/cloudflare/wrangler.jsonc"},{"title":"安装原有密钥","body":"沿用原来的注册密钥和运维密钥；`SHOWAI_VAULT_KEY` 为受保护的 64 位小写十六进制。","code":"npx wrangler@4.148.0 secret put SHOWAI_REGISTRATION_KEY --config deployments/cloudflare/wrangler.jsonc\nnpx wrangler@4.148.0 secret put SHOWAI_OPERATIONS_KEY --config deployments/cloudflare/wrangler.jsonc\nnpx wrangler@4.148.0 secret put SHOWAI_VAULT_KEY --config deployments/cloudflare/wrangler.jsonc"},{"title":"临时以 D1 驱动部署","body":"让源数据仍可通过运维接口访问。","code":"npx wrangler@4.148.0 deploy --config deployments/cloudflare/wrangler.jsonc --var SHOWAI_METADATA_DRIVER:d1"},{"title":"导出并核验 D1 源","body":"按上文导出和核验，之后让 D1 源**保持冻结**。"},{"title":"把元数据引导进 Durable Object","body":"反复 POST `/api/ops/metadata-bootstrap`，每次从冻结的 D1 复制一批数据。响应报告各表进度，只有结构、冻结代号、身份和表行数都核验通过后才返回 `complete: true`；重试会从持久检查点继续。源代号变化或目标已有数据时会被拒绝。","code":"curl -X POST -H \"Authorization: Bearer $(cat /secure/source-operations.key)\" \\\n  https://showai.example.com/cloud/api/ops/metadata-bootstrap"},{"title":"以默认配置部署并核验","code":"npx wrangler@4.148.0 deploy --config deployments/cloudflare/wrangler.jsonc","body":"确认 `/api/info` 报告原来的服务器身份和 `metadataDriver: durable-sqlite`，检查账号、项目权限、历史和对象读取后，只对 Durable Object 执行 `unfreeze`。","result":"服务在 Durable Object 上恢复写入，D1 源继续保持冻结。"}]},"integrity":"sha256-660edad476b2fda02cf5d65a2e90470d95d7c2335d975efaa102a0360d58f20a"},"id":"node-788298f8"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"切换后如果要回到 D1，仅改路由是不够的：先冻结并导出正在服务的 Durable Object，再用原保险库密钥把最新代号恢复到一个已核验的目标。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-7f82a3fd"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-7e82a26a"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"清理无引用的对象"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"清理分两步，"},{"type":"text","text":"两步默认都不删除任何东西","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"。报告基于一份已核验的冻结备份，保护所有修订（包括未发布和归档的历史）、清单指针、配额预留和上传任务引用的文件；最短保留期 30 天，没有可用时间的对象一律保护。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-7d82a0d7"}},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"sh","id":"node-7c829f44"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 1. 生成报告（删除 0 个对象）\nnode scripts/server-backup.mjs plan-cleanup --backup /secure/backups/showai-2026-10-09 \\\n  --destination /secure/backups/cleanup-plan.ndjson --retention-days 30\n\n# 2. 在冻结的服务器上试运行；确认后加 --apply，每次最多删除 20 个候选\nnode scripts/server-backup.mjs cleanup --url https://target.example/cloud \\\n  --key-file /secure/target-operations.key \\\n  --backup /secure/backups/showai-2026-10-09 --plan /secure/backups/cleanup-plan.ndjson \\\n  --epoch CURRENT_FROZEN_GENERATION"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"服务器会再次独立核对年龄、元数据、完整摘要和实时引用。任何维护操作执行后都会轮换冻结代号，旧报告不能重放；下一批需要重新备份并生成报告。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-73829119"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-72828f86"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"核对中断的上传"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"服务运行时会自动收尾：没有可续传任务的预留在创建 15 分钟后释放，未完成的可续传任务在开始 24 小时后连同分片和预留一起放弃，客户端下次会重新开始。冻结服务器上残留的记录，用 "},{"type":"text","text":"reconcile","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 处理。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-8184e5ba"}},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"sh","id":"node-8284e74d"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"node scripts/server-backup.mjs reconcile --url https://target.example/cloud \\\n  --key-file /secure/target-operations.key \\\n  --epoch CURRENT_FROZEN_GENERATION\n# 用 --reservation ID 选择最多 10 条记录，加 --apply 执行核验后的恢复"}]},{"type":"table","content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"残留情况"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-6d367b7b"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-ebbdc51c"}},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"加 --apply 后的处理"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-476fb610"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-ecbdc6af"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-19040383"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"对象已完整上传且校验通过"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-18a11ad8"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-10475607"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"标记为可用，"},{"type":"text","text":"保留原上传者","marks":[{"t